model g5_scen_decisions
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-31
  start 2025-12-30
  end 2026-01-05
  note "T, pre-M1 (#97, chunk 4, P13): the base of scenario boost, whose two decisions read konto, top dated on its from and lift two days after it (L §6.4): a move a scenario declares books nothing before its from, and books on the from itself and after it"

source s "a card"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input from_day: date

input late_day: date

input top_amt: money PLN

input lift_amt: money PLN

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-05)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  from_day = 2026-01-01
  late_day = 2026-01-03
  top_amt = 1.00 PLN
  lift_amt = 2.00 PLN
  opening[konto] = 10.00 PLN at 2025-12-30 start
